WEBVTT

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:25.630
So, Players in the Reapers' Game,
dead people,

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.290
"Man and woman in late teens
caught in accident, unconscious"

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:28.550
are assembled in the Underground?

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:32.140
She's dead, and so am I.

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:35.100
We're in this game for a second chance.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.020
But then...

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:39.810
...why did I die?

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.310
Oh, Neku.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.280
It's no use.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:48.070
I can't remember.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:54.830
Your amnesia might have something
to do with your entry fee.

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:56.660
My what?

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:59.160
When you enter the Reapers' Game,

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:03.540
they take whatever is most
important to you. No exceptions.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:05.000
What's taking so long?
It's been 20 minutes.

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:12.510
Remember yesterday when Rhyme said
she didn't know about dreams?

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:15.430
Yeah, 'cause Skater-Brain snapped at me.

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:20.430
I bet that was because it was
taken as her entry fee.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:23.810
Just like how I can't remember anything.

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:27.440
In my case, I didn't like myself,

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:31.030
so I didn't get why they
took my appearance.

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:33.530
But now I know.

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:37.200
When I saw that I look like Eri here,

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.580
I was startled but happy.

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:44.170
I always wanted to change.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.590
I felt like I'd become Eri,
cute and capable.

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:50.460
But... I couldn't be her.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.380
I realized I was still me inside.

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:56.140
I didn't want to accept what I can't do,

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:58.970
so I got jealous of Eri
and played the victim.

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:01.430
I was shielding myself.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:07.230
In the end, what I care most about is me.

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:11.320
That's why they took my
appearance as my entry fee.

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:15.610
But I'm fine. I finally understand myself.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:18.580
Oh yeah?

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:24.920
If we survive seven days, we'll come back
to life and get our entry fees back.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:27.080
Two days to go. Let's do this!

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:31.000
Yeah.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:35.340
That said, I don't see
Beat and Rhyme around.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:37.890
They must be around here somewhere.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:39.970
What will I do if I survive?

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.400
"The World Ends With You The Animation"

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:15.400
ERASED

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:15.980
Smooth sailing, I see.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:17.570
Yes, sir!

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:19.450
Four Players remain.

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:22.830
I'll cook them all up
before tomorrow's out.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:24.540
I'm counting on it.

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:27.540
I won't fail you.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:31.420
When this game ends,
you'll officially be...

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:33.540
I am grateful and delighted.

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:37.710
Scramble Crossing

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.920
Oh! Beat! Rhyme!

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.760
Over here!

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:44.720
Don't shout so loud. It's embarrassing.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.600
Sorry about that.

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:49.310
What's the problem?
Only Players can hear us.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:52.520
Well... I guess so.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.020
Oh well. Two days to go.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.480
Don't let your guards down!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.190
Yeah!

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:00.110
Whoa!

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.780
Oh, it's just a mission.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.780
That was a total overreaction.

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:07.290
"Reach Tower Records."

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:09.960
"No time limit"?

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.370
Huh? It sounds easy, but...

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:14.290
That's a ten minutes' walk.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.630
All right!

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:19.010
Let's race to see who can
get there first, us or you guys!

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:20.380
Huh?

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:24.140
We can clear the mission,
so no complaints, right?

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:25.600
Well...

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:27.890
No cheating.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.270
Let's move, Rhyme!

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:31.520
Ah! Wait up, Beat!

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:36.570
Here we go!

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:38.530
<i>That's </i>not cheating?

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:43.910
Hey, this is way too lax!

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:46.030
"No time limit"?! What the hell?!

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.740
Are we working overtime?!

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:50.950
Yeah, yeah. Don't get your
panties in a bunch.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:57.840
Oh! There they are!

00:05:57.840 --> 00:05:59.800
Beat! Rhyme!

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:03.260
Slowpokes! I said this was a race!

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:05.510
Are you even trying?

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.300
You're the only one who is.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.350
Don't you wanna win?!

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:11.640
Why haven't you cleared the mission?

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:12.520
What?

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.560
Tower Records is right there.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.690
W-Well, about that...

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:20.190
Beat's the one who said we should wait.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:23.740
Damn it! Don't tell <i>him </i>that!

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:25.110
You're nicer than you look.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.070
Don't you get weird now!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.410
I just wanted to see the
salty look on Phones' face!

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:33.210
Wait!

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:35.250
Try to imagine.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:38.170
It's day six. The game's going well.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:40.300
The mission is simple.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:42.260
What will the Players do?

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:46.140
He's putting them off their guards.

00:06:46.140 --> 00:06:50.010
Orders straight from the top
will have their effect.

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:53.180
I guess so.

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:55.270
I can't wait to see the result.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.150
This way, Rhyme!

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:01.360
Huh?

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.320
That's...!

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:24.670
Rhyme!

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:25.880
Mr. Mew!

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:32.680
Shiki!

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:53.620
Rhyme?

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.540
Ugh.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:59.670
I hoped it'd get you all in one bite.

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:01.500
Reapers!

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:02.840
Where's...

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.380
Where's Rhyme?

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:10.510
Weren't you watching? She got erased.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:14.600
She turned into Soul and
scattered across Shibuya.

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:18.350
You bastards did this, didn't you?

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:20.100
Well, it <i>is </i>our job.

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.770
Cut the crap!

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:25.690
You... You erased Rhyme!

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:28.110
Oh, I'm <i>so </i>scared.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:32.070
The shrimp shielded you.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:34.030
Until she got erased, anyway.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.490
Shut up!

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:38.330
G-Give her back! Give back Rhyme!

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:46.960
I'd love to deal with you personally,

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:50.840
but we're only allowed to send Noise,
not attack Players.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.800
So, see you.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.350
Get back here!

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:57.310
Just following the rules.

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.190
Get back here.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:10.280
Beating the Noise comes first!

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:15.280
They eat each other?!

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.410
They're its prey!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:19.660
It'll keep growing unless we
take out the little ones first.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.960
This one's mine!

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:24.880
What?!

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:28.260
This is the Noise that got Rhyme!

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:30.670
Beat!

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.670
Give it a rest.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.800
You?!

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:33.260
From that time...

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:34.300
Name's Hanekoma.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.050
Let go!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.640
You can't beat Noise without a partner.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.180
Like I care!

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:44.560
A Player who loses his partner
has minutes left to live.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.360
I don't wanna live without Rhyme!

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:49.280
Do you want to waste your partner's death?

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.700
Don't give up.

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:55.450
I'll figure it out.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:58.290
Beat...

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:01.120
I'll get them back for Rhyme.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.330
Leave this to us.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.540
Yeah.

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:05.960
Don't let us down.

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:10.010
This might be tricky.

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:11.550
Start with the small fry.

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:12.760
Yeah.

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:23.520
I'll erase... every last one!

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:44.000
Just that big Noise left.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.210
Yup.

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:51.510
Neku.

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:52.710
Not yet.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.300
Focus.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.260
Now!

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:08.310
Get lost!

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.490
We did it, right?

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.700
Yeah.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.420
It's just us now, huh?

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:33.880
You're gonna come back to life
and make clothes with Eri, right?

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.130
Yeah.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.590
One day left.

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:39.720
No matter what,

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.350
let's win and live.

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:48.770
Today's the last day.

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:52.440
"Defeat the Game Master
at the Shuto Expressway."

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:54.650
And that'll end the game?

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.110
"Defeat the Game Master at the Shuto Expressway.
You have 600 minutes.
Fail, and face erasure. -The Reapers"

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:57.740
Yeah.

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.450
Rhyme.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:00.700
Beat.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.620
We can't give up.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:07.540
A call?

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:09.790
It's me, Hanekoma.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.130
Beat's gone.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:12.170
What?!

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:14.460
Just end the game ASAP.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:19.470
Once it ends, the Reapers will
have no reason to erase Beat.

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:20.390
Got it.

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:22.100
This is day seven.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:25.560
The Game Master, Higashizawa, is tough.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.390
Don't die on me now!

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:31.770
Hane--<i>Mr. </i>Hanekoma, why are
you so concerned about us?

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.400
You'll know someday.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:40.280
Neku, let's end the Reapers' Game.

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.910
Yeah.

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:43.450
Let's do our best.

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:50.330
We've got nothing to do on day seven.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:54.250
The last day is the
Game Master's time to shine.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:57.260
Our job's done.

00:12:57.260 --> 00:13:01.340
Ugh. I could have scored some points
if I'd managed to take them out.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.010
Thank you for waiting.

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.300
Two Mexican dogs.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.810
Thanks.

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:07.600
I always appreciate it.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:10.810
I should be thanking you.

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:12.520
Please, take your time.

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:13.980
You're too kind.

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.570
Hey!

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:18.110
Uzuki?! That one's mine!

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.280
I know.

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:21.410
Is this some kind of harassment?!

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:23.450
You...

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:27.750
Let's recharge until our next job.

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:31.250
Don't just take things
people care about...

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:36.300
...and then sit around chatting,
you damn Reapers!

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:41.800
Shibuya Station Underpass

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:48.810
What's up?

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:52.020
I was just thinking that...
I've realized a lot.

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:57.860
I've been happy and sad.
I've never felt so alive.

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:59.860
But I'm dead.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:03.360
This isn't the end.
We'll win and come back to life.

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:06.160
Neku.

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:11.160
Thanks for these seven days.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:15.460
I wouldn't have made it
this far without you.

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:17.340
We're not done yet.

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:19.090
You're right.

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:23.840
When we come back to life,
I want all of us to meet up again.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:29.350
I'll think about it.

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:31.020
Great.

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:33.890
I probably won't look like this...

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:40.360
...so you can recognize me by Mr. Mew.

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:42.190
OK.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:43.400
I'll find you.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.360
Toward Central Circular Route

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.360
Road closed
for construction

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:59.500
Now I can finally get cooking.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.210
We're not gonna lose!

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:04.680
Come now, young lady,

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:09.180
what happened to those passions
you kept bottled up like squid ink?

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:10.810
They're still here,

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:15.640
but... I'm not ashamed of how I feel!

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:19.730
Your dark, boiling jealousy
of your friend?

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:23.400
That's right. My best friend
Eri is so amazing I'm jealous,

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:26.610
and she's waiting in the Realground!

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:30.330
I'll come back to life and
make clothes with her!

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:33.250
I see you've gone stale, young lady.

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:36.040
But a great chef like me...

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:38.250
...can make a fine meal...

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:40.040
...out of any ingredients!

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:58.520
Let me!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.990
Go!

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:36.510
What?

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.520
Watch out!

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:44.900
Run!

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:51.200
Neku!

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.160
Shiki!

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:58.330
I'm fine!

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:03.460
We can't take another one of those.

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:05.590
Let's make this quick.

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:07.380
Yeah.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:08.260
Let's go!

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:09.300
Right!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.230
Got him!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.330
Neku!

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:37.540
Mr. Mew!

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:42.080
Sorry.

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:58.180
This is...

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:02.440
...the end!

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:24.210
To think that I... could lose.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:30.460
Mr. Kitaniji... I'm terribly... sorry.

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:39.260
Is it over?

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:42.310
Yeah. We won.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:47.360
Then, we get to come back to life.

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:50.150
It looks like we're blessed.

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:51.360
Neku!

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:08.960
Where are we?

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:11.510
Are we alive again?

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:14.010
Not yet, I'm sorry to say.

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:15.260
Who're you?

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:18.510
A loyal servant of the Composer.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:21.970
Kitaniji, Conductor of the Reapers' Game.

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:25.310
Congratulations on your victory.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:29.400
First of all, this game
allows for the rebirth...

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:31.570
...of one person.

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:32.860
What?!

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:36.530
Don't all the survivors get to come back?!

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:39.870
The Composer put this rule in place.

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:42.330
It cannot be overturned.

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:45.750
This inspection will revive...

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:47.420
...Shiki Misaki.

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:48.960
Me?

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:51.710
But why?!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:55.010
We monitor all Players' growth.

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:58.800
You confronted yourself and
overcame your weakness.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:02.060
Thus, you are the worthiest of rebirth.

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:06.390
That's all the more reason why Neku
should come back and not me!

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:09.520
Neku's changed in these seven days!

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:13.150
He pushed everyone away at first,

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:15.900
but he listened to me.

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:19.910
He told me that I'm fine the way I am!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:24.790
That made me so, so happy.

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:27.000
Shiki, you should live.

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:28.920
Huh? Why?

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:30.830
I want you to live!

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:33.250
If you are attached to life,

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.710
you may enter the game again.

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:38.300
If you enjoy destruction,

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.800
you may even become a Reaper.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.930
I won't become a Reaper.

00:20:42.930 --> 00:20:46.230
I still don't know why I died.

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:51.150
I don't really even know if I
want to come back to life.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:57.400
So, I'll take another shot
at the Reapers' Game.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:58.740
Neku.

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:02.280
Don't cry, Shiki.

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:05.080
I...

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:09.290
Are you prepared?

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:10.500
Yeah.

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:18.840
Shiki?!

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:20.090
Shiki!

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:25.100
I can't touch her?!

00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:29.180
Is this what you call "rebirth"?!

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:33.400
No. I've collected your second entry fee.

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:34.480
What?!

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:40.240
Neku Sakuraba, you desire to play
the Reapers' Game a second time.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:43.910
You can't do that without an entry fee.

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:46.200
Don't tell me...

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:47.580
Exactly.

00:21:47.580 --> 00:21:52.250
Your entry fee, the thing that
currently matters most to you...

00:21:52.250 --> 00:21:53.670
No way...

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:55.000
Neku.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.960
...is Shiki Misaki.

00:21:58.130 --> 00:21:59.090
Neku!

00:21:59.090 --> 00:22:00.630
Stop.

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:02.050
Stop this!

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:05.010
Neku...

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:06.220
Shiki!

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:17.900
Stop!

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:02.000
REAPERS

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:02.000
REAPERS

00:23:59.380 --> 00:24:01.500
Next time: "Reapers."
